      "value": "Disagree. \n1) It's not good idea to approve something except for default/official shaders, because otherwise drama is guaranteed.\n2) Don't think that all toon shaders are cubed. There is tons of cubed shader mods for different purposes and ppl use it.\n3) Main idea of shader block is exactly blocking shitty shaders, like cubed's.\n\nBut may be devs should make ability to whitelist some shaders personaly in config, so ppl can allow some shaders they want. This would be very useful.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
