      "value": "@{5a9fe9983955314156acc4f7|full_name}: \n1. What drama exactly? Nearly everyone (especially people who aren't experienced with Avatars) used cubeds. Only the experts/hackers are using other shaders \n\n2. Obviously not all toon shaders are cubeds. This comparable to the stone-pebble argument where not all stones are pebbles but all pebbles are stone \n\n3. Cubeds is not a shitty shader. Even the Devs know it. It's not even annoying at all or causing lag. I guess you need to fix your computer.",
