      "value": "@{5a0149885541be090f3b818a|full_name}: \nThis is a stupid argument. I know that it has to be absolute but cubeds is already trusted a lot with the devs. The devs knew that there are almost no technical issues behind it since the person who made it is with them. What you said is infuriating.",
