      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be good to have a VRChat team designed \"Toonshader\" fallback option that, as long as any of the big popular toon shaders (like xtoon/poiyome/cubed/etc) have set up the fallback input naming correctly it will then just render a super efficient, and slightly nerfed, \"toon\" fallback version of the shader with all textures connected to the right places.\nso yes it will look \"less pretty\"  but it will still look like \"a toonshader\"",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
